# Copy to .env and fill in. The backend loads .env on startup.

# Anthropic API key: gets the chat panel talking to Claude. Choose ONE:
#
# 1) API-key flow: get a key from https://console.anthropic.com/, then:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# 2) Subscription flow (Claude Max / Pro): run `claude /login` once on
#    this host, and the SDK will pick up the stored token automatically.
#    No env var needed for this path.
#
# 3) CI / tests: force the stub echo handler instead of calling Anthropic.
# ATLC3_GUI_CHAT_STUB=1
